Subject: [#94-9-392] Inventors group

This may be showing up in a subscribe list near you...


All this group, "alt.inventors", is for those inventors trying to buck 
the odd or wishing to show prior art to stop patents from being 
misappropriated by nefarious organizations...

The main points of discussion approved within alt.inventors:

1. To be a useful forum to get Inventors into a postive light.

2. To promote First to Invent support to protect the independent inventor.

3. To screen out NOT INVENTED HERE companies from being ever approached.

4. To discuss techniques in researching, developing, filing, patenting $'s.

5. To openly discuss prior art where applicable, especially in software.

6. To consider tools and tricks of the trade, e.g. stereolithography.

7. To locate competent counsel, searchers, associated services.

8. To locate Internet invention services and resources.

9. To announce at one's own risk their ideas for prior art declaration!
   (this is a public forum and giving away your ideas in it may 
    affect your ability to file for and get approval of a patent
    at all in the U.S. and foreign countries.  Only do so if
    the idea is to be placed into the public domain or your
    patent advisor/attorney says so and you are willing to assume risk!)

10. To allow announcements of inventors filings being available for license!

11. To hold announcements of meetings and conferences specifically 
    useful to inventors/innovators or those that wish to find and pay them
    for their efforts!

12. To post filing forms templates or where to ftp them.

This of course is all subject to change because an astute inventor is the 
delta force of an overworked word CHANGE!

cmsg newgroup alt.inventors  a discussion area for inventors, many areas!



P. S. This is a beginning of a brighter future.


